{"2840580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Myoka: First Person View", "steam_appid": 2840580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myoka is <strong>&quot;Gran Turismo for Drones,&quot;</strong> designed as an RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a student at <strong>Myoka School of Drones &amp; Aviation</strong> — learning to design, build, and fly drones while working gigs around the city to survive and pay for school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build.</strong> Assemble your quad from real parts on a real workbench. Pick the right tool, drive the right screws, learn what every component does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tune.</strong> Real BetaFlight-style PIDs, rates, and curves. Dial your quad in until it flies the way <i>you</i> fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly.</strong> From cinematic cruisers to full-acro 5&quot; freestyle rigs. Physics built on real motor and prop data — what works on the bench works in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn.</strong> Take gigs around the city. Pay tuition. Unlock levels. Upgrade your fleet. Earn your wings.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myoka is <strong>&quot;Gran Turismo for Drones,&quot;</strong> designed as an RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a student at <strong>Myoka School of Drones &amp; Aviation</strong> — learning to design, build, and fly drones while working gigs around the city to survive and pay for school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build.</strong> Assemble your quad from real parts on a real workbench. Pick the right tool, drive the right screws, learn what every component does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tune.</strong> Real BetaFlight-style PIDs, rates, and curves. Dial your quad in until it flies the way <i>you</i> fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly.</strong> From cinematic cruisers to full-acro 5&quot; freestyle rigs. Physics built on real motor and prop data — what works on the bench works in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn.</strong> Take gigs around the city. Pay tuition. Unlock levels. Upgrade your fleet. Earn your wings.</p>", "short_description": "Myoka is &quot;Gran Turismo for Drones,&quot; designed as an RPG. You're a student at Myoka School of Drones &amp; Aviation — learning to design, build, and fly drones while working gigs around the city to survive and pay for school.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840580/2561be34fb5c3dac498b3c798b48cca024af2205/header.jpg?t=1782794167", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840580/305303d96f3a84fab2a1286c7e19870139258512/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782794167", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840580/305303d96f3a84fab2a1286c7e19870139258512/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782794167", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 7/Intel 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX16<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 9<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX4090<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"}